<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/11th-century">11th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1054</h1><p class="ref-lede">1054 in world history: 6 events, 5 deaths and 1 state founded. 454 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
<nav class="ref-letters yr-near" aria-label="Nearby years"><a href="/years/1037">1037</a><a href="/years/1040">1040</a><a href="/years/1044">1044</a><a href="/years/1047">1047</a><a href="/years/1054" aria-current="page">1054</a><a href="/years/1055">1055</a><a href="/years/1057">1057</a><a href="/years/1063">1063</a><a href="/years/1065">1065</a></nav>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mortemer" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-mortemer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mortemer">Battle of Mortemer</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Mortemer was fought in February 1054 in upper Normandy, when forces of Duke William of Normandy surprised and destroyed one of two French armies that King Henry I of France had sent to invade the duchy.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Siege</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/almoravid-capture-of-awdaghast">Almoravid capture of Awdaghast</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Almoravid capture of Awdaghast was the seizure of the Saharan trading town of Awdaghast by the Almoravids in 1054.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-atapuerca">Battle of Atapuerca</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Atapuerca was fought on 1 September 1054 near Burgos between two sons of Sancho III of Navarre.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-koppam">Battle of Koppam</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Koppam was fought in 1054 between the Chola king Rajadhiraja I and the Western Chalukya king Someshvara I, probably near the Krishna or Tungabhadra river.</p></div></li></ol></section>
